DESCRIPTION:The ISCTM 23rd Annual Scientific Meeting is scheduled for Feb
 ruary 23 to 25\, 2027\, in Washington\, DC\, with preliminary events on 
 February 22. Poster submissions close November 16\, 2026 and New Investi
 gator Award submissions close November 3\, 2026.\n\nDeadlines\nLewis A. 
 Opler Prize recommendation: 2026-10-15\nNew Investigator Award submissio
 n: 2026-11-03\nPoster submission: 2026-11-16\nSession proposals for the 
 2028 Annual Meeting: 2027-01-07\n\nhttps://isctm.org/meeting/23rd-annual
 -scientific-meeting/
LOCATION:Washington\, District of Columbia
URL:https://isctm.org/meeting/23rd-annual-scientific-meeting/
